<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Kerajaan Republik Singapura boleh menyebabkan supaya dikeluarkan suatu pas berkaitan kepada setiap pegawai penguat kuasa Malaysia yang pengerahan tugasnya telah diluluskan di bawah subseksyen (2)."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Pegawai penguat kuasa Malaysia yang kepadanya telah dikeluarkan pas berkaitan di bawah subseksyen (3) hendaklah, atas permintaan oleh pihak berkuasa Kerajaan Republik Singapura, mengemukakan pasnya atau keterangan mengenai identitinya yang lain untuk pengesahan semasa melaksanakan tugas rasmi di Stesen Woodlands North."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "5" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Seorang pegawai penguat kuasa Malaysia boleh, semasa melaksanakan tugas rasmi di Stesen Woodlands North, memakai pakaian seragam atau apa-apa lambang tersendiri yang jelas kelihatan agensi penguatkuasaannya."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "6" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "Kerajaan Malaysia hendaklah memanggil balik mana-mana pegawai penguat kuasa Malaysia yang dikerah tugas di Stesen Woodlands North jika dikehendaki oleh Kerajaan Republik Singapura."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "7" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_7> <https://schema.org/text> "Kerajaan Malaysia hendaklah, tidak kurang daripada tujuh hari sebelum tarikh pengerahan tugas seseorang pegawai penguat kuasa Malaysia di Stesen Woodlands North tamat, memberitahu Kerajaan Republik Singapura secara bertulis."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_III__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
