<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_VI__cl_19__subsec_1__para_c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_VI__cl_19__subsec_1__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "di atas landasan Rapid Transit System Link di antara Tiang 47 dan Tiang 48."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
