<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_V__cl_13> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_V> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_V__cl_13> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "13" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_V__cl_13> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_V__cl_13> <https://schema.org/text> "Kerajaan Malaysia dan Kerajaan Republik Singapura hendaklah mengemukakan perkembangan semasa kepada satu sama lain—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
