<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_V__cl_13__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "mengenai apa-apa insiden rentas sempadan; atau"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
