<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_V__cl_14__subsec_1__para_a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_V__cl_14__subsec_1__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "Kerajaan Malaysia hendaklah bertanggungjawab untuk menguruskan insiden itu jika perjalanan kereta api Rapid Transit System Link disempurnakan di dalam wilayah Malaysia; atau"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_V__cl_14__subsec_1__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@/~part_V__cl_14__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/1/msa@> .
